      "date": "2026-04-24T13:04:49.000Z",
      "title": "NTPC: Dividend Payout And Energy Storage Plans Will Support Future Appeal",
      "body": "Analysts have inched up their price target on NTPC to about ₹425 from roughly ₹424, reflecting slightly adjusted assumptions around the discount rate, revenue growth, profit margins and future P/E expectations. What's in the News Board meeting scheduled on 28 March 2026 at 11:10 Indian Standard Time to review an investment proposal for a Battery Energy Storage System with a total capacity of 4.70 GWh and an estimated project cost of ₹58,219 million, along with other agenda items (company filing).",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": "https://simplywall.st/community/narratives/in/utilities/nse-ntpc/ntpc-shares/jkpi723z-renewable-and-nuclear-expansion-will-secure-future-earnings-stability-2hg8/updates/14-analysts-have-inched-up-their-price-target-on-ntpc-to-about",
