    {
      "id": "42fb3dc0-b28f-458d-8dc2-86546fb1fa18",
      "type": "narrative-update",
      "date": "2026-04-07T02:08:26.000Z",
      "title": "NTPC: Dividend Strength And Storage Investments Will Support Long Term Appeal",
      "body": "Analysts have kept NTPC's fair value estimate steady at ₹424.46, with a slightly higher discount rate and P/E assumption, as well as a small adjustment to revenue growth and profit margin expectations shaping this updated price target view. What's in the News A board meeting is scheduled for Mar 28, 2026, to review an investment proposal for a Battery Energy Storage System with 4.70 GWh capacity at an estimated project cost of ₹58,219m, along with other matters (Board Meeting).",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": "https://simplywall.st/community/narratives/in/utilities/nse-ntpc/ntpc-shares/jkpi723z-renewable-and-nuclear-expansion-will-secure-future-earnings-stability-2hg8/updates/13-analysts-have-kept-ntpcs-fair-value-estimate-steady-at-indian-rupee424",
