    },
    {
      "id": "af88e22c-b7a8-40b9-8192-e36f3f367fdc",
      "type": "narrative-update",
      "date": "2026-03-23T19:05:57.000Z",
      "title": "NTPC: Dividend Strength And Gasification Projects Will Support Long Term Appeal",
      "body": "Analysts have lifted their price target for NTPC from ₹413.28 to ₹424.46, citing updated assumptions around the discount rate, revenue growth, profit margin and future P/E as key drivers of the change. What's in the News NTPC signed an MoU with Gujarat Mineral Development Corporation to explore coal and lignite gasification projects in Odisha and Gujarat.",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": "https://simplywall.st/community/narratives/in/utilities/nse-ntpc/ntpc-shares/jkpi723z-renewable-and-nuclear-expansion-will-secure-future-earnings-stability-2hg8/updates/12-analysts-have-lifted-their-price-target-for-ntpc-from-indian-rupee4132",
